\section*{Module 3: 课堂练习排版 (Class Practice)}

当进入课堂练习 (Class Practice) 或作业 (Assignment) 阶段时，我们不再使用封闭的盒子，而是回归最原始、留白最大的清爽排版。
利用定制的 \texttt{\textbackslash cieq} 和 \texttt{\textbackslash ciesub} 命令，确保题号绝对垂直对齐。

\vspace{0.4cm}
\noindent\textbf{【课堂限时挑战】 Speed Challenge}

\cieq{1} 基础计算 (Basic Calculations)
\ciesub{a} Evaluate $15^2 - 12^2$.
\par\vspace{0.4cm}\noindent\textbf{Answer:} \makebox[4cm]{\dotfill}

\ciesub{b} Write down the value of $\sqrt{169}$.
\par\vspace{0.4cm}\noindent\textbf{Answer:} \makebox[4cm]{\dotfill}

\cieq{2} 图形综合题 (Geometric Application)
\par\vspace{0.2cm}\noindent The diagram shows a rectangle $ABCD$ where $AB = 12\text{ cm}$ and $BC = 5\text{ cm}$.
\par\vspace{0.4cm}
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1]
    \coordinate (A) at (0,2);
    \coordinate (B) at (4,2);
    \coordinate (C) at (4,0);
    \coordinate (D) at (0,0);
    
    \draw[thick] (A) -- (B) node[midway, above] {$12\text{ cm}$} -- (C) -- (D) -- cycle;
    \draw[thick, dashed, NovaBlue] (A) -- (C);
    
    \node[above left] at (A) {$A$};
    \node[above right] at (B) {$B$};
    \node[below right] at (C) {$C$};
    \node[below left] at (D) {$D$};
    \node[right] at (4,1) {$5\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}

\ciesub{a} Calculate the length of the diagonal $AC$. (求对角线 $AC$ 的长度)
\par\vspace{0.6cm}\noindent\textbf{Working:} \makebox[10cm]{\dotfill}
\par\vspace{0.4cm}\noindent\makebox[12cm]{\dotfill}
\par\vspace{0.4cm}\noindent\textbf{Answer:} $AC =$ \makebox[2.5cm]{\dotfill} cm

\ciesub{b} Point $M$ is the exact midpoint of $AC$. What is the distance from $A$ to $M$?
\par\vspace{0.6cm}\noindent\textbf{Working:} \makebox[10cm]{\dotfill}
\par\vspace{0.4cm}\noindent\textbf{Answer:} $AM =$ \makebox[2.5cm]{\dotfill} cm

